---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 葉影帖
description: KUSARIUM 的插畫與視覺標本。
permalink: /gallery/index.html
---
<header class="page-intro shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">ILLUSTRATED SPECIMENS</p>
  <h1>葉影帖</h1>
  <p>將畫面依採集日期輕輕放好。點開任意一頁，也可以讀到它旁邊留下的文字。</p>
</header>

<section class="gallery shell section" aria-label="插畫與視覺標本">
  {% if collections.gallery.length %}
    <div class="gallery-grid">
      {% for post in collections.gallery %}
        <article class="gallery-item" lang="{{ post.data.language | default(site.language) }}">
          <button class="gallery-item__image" type="button" data-lightbox-trigger data-src="{{ post.data.cover }}" data-alt="{{ post.data.coverAlt | default(post.data.title) }}" data-caption="{{ post.data.title }}" aria-label="放大查看：{{ post.data.title }}">
            <img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="{{ post.data.coverAlt | default(post.data.title) }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="--image-focus-x: {{ post.data.coverFocusX | default(50) }}%; --image-focus-y: {{ post.data.coverFocusY | default(50) }}%; --image-scale: {{ post.data.coverZoom | imageScale }};">
            <span class="gallery-item__view">VIEW</span>
          </button>
          <div class="gallery-item__caption">
            <div>
              <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateIso }}">{{ post.date | dateReadable }}</time>
              <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
              {% if post.data.passwordProtected %}<p class="entry-lock"><span aria-hidden="true">⌑</span> 提示：{{ post.data.passwordHint | default("未設定提示", true) }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>
            <span>{{ loop.index | pad2 }}</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state">
      <span class="empty-state__mark" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
      <h2>葉影帖仍在等待第一頁</h2>
      <p>為文章加入 <code>cover</code> 圖片後，它便會自動出現在這裡。</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<dialog class="lightbox" data-lightbox>
  <button class="lightbox__close" type="button" data-lightbox-close aria-label="關閉大圖">×</button>
  <div class="lightbox__stage">
    <button class="lightbox__nav lightbox__nav--prev" type="button" data-lightbox-prev aria-label="查看上一頁">←</button>
    <figure>
      <img src="" alt="" data-lightbox-image>
      <figcaption data-lightbox-status aria-live="polite"></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <button class="lightbox__nav lightbox__nav--next" type="button" data-lightbox-next aria-label="查看下一頁">→</button>
  </div>
</dialog>
